  <PreviewImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4b1310a22146e83469914083c0b8612b, type: 3}
  <Rules>k__BackingField:
  - Touch a rival to pass the bomb
  - The holder runs a little faster
  - The bomb pulses faster before it blows
  <Objective>k__BackingField: Don't be holding the bomb when it explodes.
  <Danger>k__BackingField: The bomb blasts its holder out. It can't be passed straight
    back.
  <Scoring>k__BackingField: Last one standing wins; the order of explosions decides
    the rest.
  <Controls>k__BackingField:
  - Touch|Pass the bomb
  - LMB|Shove
